      "content": "To build your case, emphasize how UBI directly decouples basic survival from precarious employment in an automated economy. Argue that a guaranteed income acts as an essential economic stabilizer, preventing mass poverty and consumer demand collapse as middle-class jobs disappear. Furthermore, position UBI not just as a handout, but as an investment that promotes entrepreneurship and community engagement outside of traditional work structures. This frames it as a forward-thinking adaptation, rather than simply a welfare measure.",
