      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Counter their cost objections by framing UBI not as an *expense*, but as a necessary public infrastructure investment against economic decay. Emphasize that unchecked AI displacement leads to mass social cost—unemployment, crime, and instability—which far outweighs the UBI payout. Furthermore, project that the massive productivity gains from automation will generate unprecedented wealth, which the UBI system can tax or redistribute, effectively financing itself through increased efficiency.",
      "source": "target",
